
# Simple Calculator Using C

## Introduction
This project is a simple calculator developed
using the C programming language.

## Operations
1. Addition
2. Subtraction
3. Multiplication
4. Division

## Concepts Used
- Functions
- Switch Statement
- If-Else Statement
- Do-While Loop

## Software Requirements
- C Programming
- GCC Compiler
- Programiz Online Compiler

## Conclusion
This project helps beginners understand
functions and control structures in C.
